OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome bright spells and showery
OL,6,Frain to start. Soon turning cloudy
OL,7,Fwith further outbreaks of rain, likely
OL,8,Fturning heavy at times through the
OL,9,Fafternoon, particularly for Shetland.
OL,10,FStrengthening northeasterly winds
OL,11,Fdeveloping.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy and windy with
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain in the evening,
OL,15,Foccasionally heavy. Rain clearing
OL,16,FOrkney overnight and becoming lighter
OL,17,Ffor Shetland, but north backing
OL,18,Fnorthwest winds remaining fresh.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
