OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FRain and stronger winds soon
OL,6,Fclearing Shetland. Otherwise a dry day
OL,7,Fwith variable cloud and some bright
OL,8,Fspells.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry and
OL,11,Fbright spells on Sunday and Monday but
OL,12,Falso a few showers at times, rain
OL,13,Fspreading east later Monday. Becoming
OL,14,Fbreezy with scattered occasionally
OL,15,Fheavy showers on Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
